      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-04-26T22:11:16.562Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Uh, Days That Never Were is a Special Rule, not an Innate Power.</p>\n<p>Anyway, it reads . . .</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Days That Never Were\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Days That Never Were:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Your 3rd Growth option lets you gain any one Power Card from a special set you create during Setup. When you gain a Power Card any other way, you may add one unchosen card to this set.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The usage of “set” rather than “deck” or “pile” and “gain <em>any one</em> Power Card” implies to me that it is a collection of face-up cards that you may freely choose from, like <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/mindwanderer\">@MindWanderer</a> said.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-04-26T22:11:16.562Z",
