      "raw": "Uh, Days That Never Were is a Special Rule, not an Innate Power.\n\nAnyway, it reads . . .\n\n[quote=\"Days That Never Were\"]\nYour 3rd Growth option lets you gain any one Power Card from a special set you create during Setup. When you gain a Power Card any other way, you may add one unchosen card to this set.\n[/quote]\n\nThe usage of \"set\" rather than \"deck\" or \"pile\" and \"gain *any one* Power Card\" implies to me that it is a collection of face-up cards that you may freely choose from, like @MindWanderer said.",
